  "body": [
    {
      "_key": "nb188",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns187",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The Gili Islands are where a very large number of people get certified, and the reason is not marketing. The water is warm and clear, the reefs start close to shore, there is no traffic to dodge on the way to the shop, and turtles are close to a daily occurrence. What people get wrong is the schedule: they book four nights, put the course on days one to three, and discover that a course you cannot fail is still a course you can rush. Seven days gives you the certification and then the dives that make it worth having."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb190",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns189",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Who this trip is for"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb192",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns191",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Complete beginners who want an open water certification without treating a holiday as an exam, and solo travellers or friends who want an easy social base while they learn. It also works for couples where one dives and one does not, because the snorkelling here is genuinely good from the beach."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb194",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns193",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "It is not for you if you want dramatic big-animal diving, if you need nightlife-free silence on every island, or if you are already an experienced diver looking for current and depth. Experienced divers should go to Nusa Penida or Komodo instead."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb196",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns195",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Trip at a glance"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb199",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns197",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Route: "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns198",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Bali to Gili Trawangan, then Gili Air, then back to Bali."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb202",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns200",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Base changes: "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns201",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Two. Four nights on Trawangan for the course, three on Air for the quieter half."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb205",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns203",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Pace: "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns204",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Balanced. Course mornings are structured, afternoons are yours."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb208",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns206",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Gets you: "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns207",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "An open water certification plus four or five logged fun dives, rather than a card and nothing else."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb210",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns209",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Why this route makes sense"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb212",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns211",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Doing the course on Trawangan and the fun dives from Air is deliberate. Trawangan has the highest concentration of dive schools, so if you do not click with an instructor you have alternatives. Gili Air is quieter and cheaper to linger on, which is what you want once the classroom part is done and you are just diving and eating."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb214",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns213",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "How long does it take to learn to dive in the Gili Islands?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb216",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns215",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "An open water course takes three to four days: theory and pool skills first, then four open water dives. Three days is possible but leaves no slack. Add at least two more days of fun diving afterwards, because the skills only settle once you are diving without an instructor talking you through every step."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nt217",
      "_type": "comparisonTable",
      "caption": "Prices checked in 2026 across several Gili schools and quoted in rupiah. They move, and packages of several dives usually cut the per-dive price by around 10 to 15 percent, so confirm before you commit.",
      "columns": ["Option", "Time needed", "Roughly what it costs", "Best for"],
      "rows": [
        {
          "_key": "nr218",
          "cells": [
            "Discover Scuba, one dive",
            "Half a day",
            "Well under the cost of a course",
            "Deciding whether you like it at all"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_key": "nr219",
          "cells": [
            "Open Water certification",
            "Three to four days",
            "Around IDR 6.2 to 6.9 million in 2026",
            "Anyone who wants to keep diving after"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_key": "nr220",
          "cells": [
            "Open Water plus fun dives",
            "Six to seven days",
            "Course plus roughly IDR 490,000 to 640,000 a dive",
            "This itinerary, and the reason it is seven days"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_key": "nr221",
          "cells": [
            "Advanced course",
            "Two extra days",
            "Varies by school",
            "Divers who already hold Open Water"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb223",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns222",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Day 1: Cross from Bali and pick your school"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb226",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns224",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Morning. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns225",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Fast boat from Bali. Budget 1.5 to 2.5 hours at sea plus the road transfer to the port, and take a morning departure."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb229",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns227",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Afternoon. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns228",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Walk the main strip and visit three dive schools in person. Ask about group size and how many students per instructor."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb232",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns230",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Evening. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns231",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Sign up for a course starting tomorrow, not today."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb235",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns233",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Base: "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns234",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Gili Trawangan, four nights."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb241",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns237",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Booking logic: "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns238",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Crossings sell out in peak season, so "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns239",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["nm236"],
          "text": "compare Bali to Gili Trawangan boats on 12Go"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns240",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " before you fix your dates. Published fares start around IDR 275,000 and vary a lot by operator."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "nm236",
          "_type": "affiliateLinkRef",
          "placeholderId": "12GO_BALI_GILI_TRAWANGAN"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb244",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns242",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Travel note: "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns243",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Afternoon seas are rougher and a cancelled boat can cost you a day of the course. Book the morning crossing."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb246",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns245",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Day 2: Theory and confined water"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb249",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns247",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Morning. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns248",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Classroom and the shallows. Mask clearing and regulator recovery are the bits people find unpleasant, and they are over quickly."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb252",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns250",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Afternoon. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns251",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "More confined water skills. This is the least glamorous day and the one that makes the rest work."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb255",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns253",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Evening. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns254",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Study the theory. It is not hard, but it is not optional."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb258",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns256",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Travel note: "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns257",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "If you are struggling with equalising, say so early. Instructors can slow this down, but not if they find out on dive three."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb260",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns259",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Day 3: First two open water dives"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb263",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns261",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Morning. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns262",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Two dives at shallow sites. Everything feels fast and slightly overwhelming, which is normal."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb266",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns264",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Afternoon. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns265",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Rest and log the dives properly."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb269",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns267",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Evening. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns268",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Early night."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb271",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns270",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Day 4: Final dives and certification"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb274",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns272",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Morning. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns273",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Dives three and four, usually including a site with a decent chance of turtles."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb277",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns275",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Afternoon. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns276",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Paperwork and certification."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb280",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns278",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Evening. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns279",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Worth marking. You are a diver."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb283",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns281",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Travel note: "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns282",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Do not book your onward boat for this afternoon. Courses slip by half a day all the time."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb285",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns284",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Day 5: Cross to Gili Air and dive as a certified diver"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb288",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns286",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Morning. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns287",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Short local boat to Gili Air."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb291",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns289",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Afternoon. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns290",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "One fun dive. This is the first one where nobody is watching your every move, and it is the one that teaches you the most."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb294",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns292",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Base: "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns293",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Gili Air, three nights."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb300",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns296",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Book early: "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns297",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Gili Air fills earlier than people expect in July and August, so compare "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns298",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["nm295"],
          "text": "stays on Gili Air"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns299",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " before you leave Bali."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "nm295",
          "_type": "affiliateLinkRef",
          "placeholderId": "BOOKING_GILI_AIR"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb303",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns301",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Travel note: "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns302",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The local boats between the Gilis run to a sparse fixed schedule, not on demand. Check the times the day before."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb305",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns304",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Day 6: Two fun dives, and the reef in daylight"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb308",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns306",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Morning. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns307",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Two dives. Ask for a site with a slight drift so you learn to let the water do the work."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb311",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns309",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Afternoon. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns310",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Snorkel off the east side. The turtles are shallower than people expect."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb314",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns312",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Evening. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns313",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Sunset on the west side, which faces Bali and Mount Agung on a clear day."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb316",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns315",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Day 7: Back to Bali"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb319",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns317",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Morning. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns318",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Fast boat back. Leave the morning free and do not dive today."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb322",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns320",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Travel note: "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns321",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Leave 18 to 24 hours between your last dive and any flight. If you are flying out of Bali the same evening, your last dive needs to be on day 6."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb324",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns323",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "What to book early, and what to keep flexible"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb326",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns325",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Book the boat from Bali and your first four nights, because arriving in peak season without a room on Trawangan is genuinely difficult. Leave the dive school itself flexible until you have walked in and met people. The single biggest difference in how much you enjoy the course is the instructor, and you cannot assess that online."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb332",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns328",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Book early: "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns329",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "For the course half of the trip, compare "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns330",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["nm327"],
          "text": "stays on Gili Trawangan"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns331",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " and stay within walking distance of the schools."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "nm327",
          "_type": "affiliateLinkRef",
          "placeholderId": "BOOKING_GILI_TRAWANGAN"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb334",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns333",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Mistakes beginners make in the Gilis"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb336",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns335",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Booking a three-day trip for a three-day course is the classic, and it leaves nothing for a delayed boat or a slow ear. Others: picking a school purely on price, drinking heavily the night before open water dives, and booking a flight home the same evening the course ends. Cash matters too, since card payment on the islands is unreliable."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb338",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns337",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "What to cut, adapt or upgrade"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb340",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns339",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Short on time, drop Gili Air and run this in five days on Trawangan alone, accepting that you finish with a certification and very little diving. If you are unsure whether you will even like it, do a Discover Scuba dive on day one and commit to the course after. Upgrading, swap the last two days for an advanced course, or add Nusa Penida later in the year once you have thirty dives behind you."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb342",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns341",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Before you build this trip"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb345",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns343",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Money. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns344",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Bring cash. Card payment across the Gilis is patchy and the ATMs run dry in peak season."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb348",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns346",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Health. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns347",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Declare asthma, ear surgery or recent illness on the medical form honestly. A doctor's sign-off obtained in advance is far easier than sorting it out on the island."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb351",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns349",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Getting around. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns350",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "There are no cars or motorbikes on the Gilis. It is bicycles, walking and horse carts, which is a large part of why the islands feel the way they do."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb357",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns353",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["strong"],
          "text": "Connectivity. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns354",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Wifi on the islands is inconsistent and you will want to confirm boat times. An "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns355",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": ["nm352"],
          "text": "Indonesia eSIM with Airalo"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns356",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " avoids hunting for a local SIM on arrival."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "nm352",
          "_type": "affiliateLinkRef",
          "placeholderId": "AIRALO_INDONESIA"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb359",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns358",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Final verdict"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb361",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns360",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "If you want to learn to dive somewhere warm, cheap and genuinely pleasant, this is one of the best places in the world to do it, and seven days is the honest minimum. Four days gets you a card. Seven gets you the confidence to use it. The diving itself is gentle rather than spectacular, so treat this as the trip that makes the next one possible, not the peak of your diving life."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nb363",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ns362",
